{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-su2-emergence-volume-determinant","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant","kind":"lemma","title":"Volume constraint forces $\\det(g_V) = 1$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/thm-su2-emergence"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-su2-emergence-volume-determinant"],"tags":["tannaka-krein","volume-constraint","determinant","sl2"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.su2_emergence_volume_determinant","text":"su2-emergence-volume-determinant.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:su2-emergence-volume-determinant\"></a><p>Every tensor automorphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">g \\in G</code> of the fibre functor <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\tau</code> satisfies the volume constraint <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\det(g_V) = 1</code>. Consequently, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">G \\subseteq \\mathrm{SL}(2, \\mathbb{C})</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/su2-emergence-volume-determinant.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"3.2.6"}
